%SIXMD 1
# @?CAT - PRINT FILE CONTENTS

## @?OPERANDS

### @?[FILE ...]
ZERO OR MORE S6REC TEXT FILES.  STANDARD INPUT IS USED WHEN NO FILE IS GIVEN.

## DESCRIPTION

CAT COPIES S6REC TEXT RECORDS TO STANDARD OUTPUT.  WITH MULTIPLE FILES IT
PROCESSES THEM IN COMMAND-LINE ORDER AND CONTINUES AFTER AN OPEN FAILURE.
USAGE IS 'CAT [FILE ...]'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
